{"id":"3490cd4d54ac2474","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-ph.md","title":"df-ph (Polynomial Hierarchy)","display":"df-ph (Polynomial Hierarchy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-pi-k-p]]"],"display":"df-ph (Polynomial Hierarchy)","label":"28-df-ph","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-ph","PH","Polynomial Hierarchy"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ph (Polynomial Hierarchy)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-ph"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-ph</span><span>PH</span><span>Polynomial Hierarchy</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\n=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PH}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\n=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>加入一个不使用的新量词块可把任意语言放入下一层的任一首量词版本，因此两个并相同。并中的层数必须是对语言固定的常数，不能随输入增长。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义5.3及其后说明；印刷97页；PDF123页。并类相等理由已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pi-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4265180c3d2ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pi-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}$、$\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-pi-k-p]]，$k\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pi-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4265180c3d2ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}$、$\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-pi-k-p]]，$k\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PH}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\n=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}.","display":true}],"bytes":896,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"多项式层级：[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-pi-k-p]]、[[28-df-delta-k-p]]、[[28-df-ph]]、[[28-df-qbf-k]]、[[28-thm-qbf-k-complete]]。"},{"id":"50694dc705d2290e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b9f22036ffa6885b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8469ff36e1bb7dd6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5fedc3d970ff1b8b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d7ec083aeafd5af7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{PH}$ 见 [[28-df-ph]]；$\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}$ 是 [[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]] 的确定型多项式时间函数 oracle 语言类，oracle 整数答复按二进制编码。"}],"outgoing":["e4f9f10bc85fd486","2bc4265180c3d2ff"]}